us skills, and there are highly flexible skill schools waiting for you to create. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich terrain and ingenious levels, the defense strategy is up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will obtain:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 20 levels and no less than 4 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 20 skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 16 talents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 4 weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 4 sets of appearance clothing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods will protect you, prepare to welcome the dawn, witch rider!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow me to get the latest updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "This is a building tower defense game with RPG elements to hunt down the demon guard altar.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/4349b1c676b29d408c83a3701695cb61800be1fa/header.jpg?t=1767792174", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/74ee14351a925756bba95430fad61ea80a211d4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767792174", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642480/74ee14351a925756bba95430fad61ea80a211d4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767792174", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3-10300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l